  "description": "A romance of temptation and trepidation. Eun-Ha, a peasant girl, is asked by a blind nobleman, Ji-Hak, to become his reading assistant. Though reluctant, she accepts the shady Ji-Hak's offer in hopes of earning enough money to free her sister from the courtesan life. And thus begins a dangerous romance of hidden intentions and passion.\n\n(Source: Manta)\n\n*Note: Includes two extra chapters.*",
